ter of HOME AFFAIRS be pleased to state:  \n \n(a) whether the Government has set up  a Committee headed by retired IAS \nofficer Sheela Bhide for apportioning the Assets  and Liabilities as per the \nAndhra Pradesh Reorganisation Act and if so, the details thereof; \n \n(b) whether the Committee has submitted its report and if so, the details of \nthe recommendations made by the Committee; \n \n(c) whether the Government has implemented all the recommendations \nmade by the said Committee; and \n \n(d) if so, the details thereof and if not, the reasons therefor along with the \ntime by which all the recommendations are likely to be implemented? \n \nMINISTER OF STATE IN THE MINISTRY OF HOME AFFAIRS \n(SHRI HANSRAJ GANGARAM AHIR) \n \n(a) to (d):  The erstwhile Government of Andhra Pradesh constituted \nExpert Committee under the Chairmanship of Mrs. Sheela Bhide for \napportioning the Assets and Liabilities of the institutions listed under \nSchedule IX of the Andhra Pradesh Reorganisation ( APR) Act, 2014, vide \nG.O. Rt. No. 223 dt. 30.5.2014. The Committee has submitted \nrecommendations on division of Assets and Liabilities in respect of 61 \ninstitutions to the State Governments for implementation.  The term of \nMrs. Sheela Bhide Committee has been extended upto February, 2017.  \n***** "}, {"k": "questions|ls|16|11|UNSTARRED |796", "t": "Production and Subsidy on Urea", "head": " \n \n \n      \nAnnexure \nStatement showing subsidy impact for the year 2014-15 & 2015-16 \n    \nSl \nNo. \n \n \n \n \n \nName of the Unit \n \n \n \n \n \n \nCapacity  (MT) \n \n \n \n \nCost of  \nProduction \n2015-16 \n (3rd \nquarter) \n(Provisiona\nl) \n \n \n \nSubsidy \n2015-16 \n \n \n \n \n \n \nSubsidy \nas % of \ntotal cost \nof \nProductio\nn 2015-\n16 \n \nCost of \nproductio\nn (Notified \nConcessio\nn Price \n2014-15)  \n \n \nSubsidy \n2014-\n15 \n \n \n \n \nSubsidy \nas % of \ntotal cost \nof \nProductio\nn 2014-\n15 \n \n  \n    MT Rs/MT Rs/MT % Rs/MT Rs/MT %  