 \n(a) whether the Government is aware of the fact that the officials of \nEast Coast Railway deliberately provide old and obsolete coaches for \nthe trains like A.P. Express No. 22415, running from Visakhapatnam to \nNew Delhi, Godavari Express from Visakhapatnam to Hyderabad, etc.; \n \n(b) if so, the specific instructions that have been issued for the \nofficials dealing with it; \n \n(c) whether any inquiry has been ordered on this issue; and \n \n(d) if so, the details thereof and if not, the reasons therefor? \n \nANSWER \nMINISTER OF STATE IN THE MINISTRY OF RAILWAYS \n \n(SHRI RAJEN GOHAIN) \n \n(a) to (d) Presently,  22415/22416 Visakhapatnam -  New Delhi \nAndhra Pradesh AC Express and  12727/12728 Visakhapatnam -\nHyderabad Godavari Express are being maintained by Northern \nRailway a nd South Central Railway respectively and is  running \nwith coaches within its prescribed codal life. Moreover, \n22415/22416 Visakhapatnam - New Delhi Andhra Pradesh AC \nExpress is running with new technology LHB (Linke Hofmann \nBusch) coaches. \n                                                               ***** "}]}